ver, whenever, and wherever they want. It's no surprise, then, that a certain hands-on situation on her first meeting with Shun invites her to misunderstand him as a bold ally in her fight for free love. Only problem is, now she clings to him at every chance, much to his dismay..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From steam"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91895"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed90c642c4728fda2a78e899b9e1cb8fb4f265129d2602c1bac2f1e65fb71936.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ee1506422ebbd3cdef39eb54f883cd0703280aed9e8610b737f8694329a11e8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"麦芽 ぷりん","creatorId":"vndb:s15910","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15910","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15910","name":"小澤 みのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85329","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91896","characterName":"三峰 みゆき","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c91896"},"originalCharacterName":"三峰 みゆき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"302"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"J"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm happy to lend you my chest whenever you need, Shun.\""},{"spoiler":false